    "title": "Nebraska vs Vanderbilt schedule, TV channel for March Madness game",
    "text": "March 19, 2026Updated March 20, 2026, 9:51 a.m. MTNo. 5 seed Vanderbilt and No. 4 seed Nebraska play in a March Madness NCAA Tournament men's college basketball game on Saturday, March 21.Here's what to know about the time, TV channel, streaming information and announcers for the South Region March Madness second-round game.Vanderbilt defeated No. 12 seed McNeese in the first round of the NCAA Tournament, 78-68.Nebraska beat No. 13 seed Troy in the Round of 64 of March Madness, 76-47.The winner of this game will advance to the Sweet 16 of the NCAA Tournament.How to watch March Madness: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game schedule, TV channelsWatch Nebraska vs Vanderbilt on Sling TVWhat time is the Vanderbilt vs Nebraska March Madness game?The Nebraska vs Vanderbilt NCAA Tournament March Madness second-round game is scheduled for 5:45 p.m. MST on Saturday, March 21.Join the madness: USA TODAY Bracket Challenge | Survivor Pool | Printable bracket | Your picks vs expertsWhat channel is the Nebraska vs Vanderbilt March Madness game on?The Vanderbilt vs Nebraska Round of 32 March Madness NCAA Tournament game can be seen on TNT.March Madness picks: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round score predictionsHow can I stream the Vanderbilt vs Nebraska March Madness game?Nebraska vs Vanderbilt can be streamed on Sling TV and other streaming services that carry TNT.Who are the announcers for the Nebraska vs Vanderbilt March Madness game?Brandon Gaudin will have the play-by-play call of the Vanderbilt Commodores vs Nebraska Cornhuskers NCAA Tournament Round of 32 game, with Chris Webber as the analyst and Andy Katz as the reporter for the March Madness second-round matchup.March Madness odds: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game oddsReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
